          <p>💬 <strong>微信公眾號</strong>：<code>agentalliance</code>（平台顯示名：校友鑑）</p>
          <p>✉️ <strong>選題投稿信箱</strong>：<a href="mailto:pitch@alumnisignal.com" class="text-purple-400 underline">pitch@alumnisignal.com</a></p>
          <p>📧 <strong>公共聯絡郵箱</strong>：<a href="mailto:alumnisignal@gmail.com" class="text-slate-400 underline">alumnisignal@gmail.com</a></p>
